              "text": "averiado — \"broken down, out of order\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "El ascensor está averiado desde el lunes. The lift has been out of order since Monday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For machines, with estar. Una avería is a breakdown."
            }
          ]
        },
