          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "averiado is built on avería 'a breakdown, damage'. Avería is usually traced to Arabic ʿawāriyya 'damaged goods', through Catalan or Italian avaria, a word of sailors and merchants."
            }
          ]
        },
